cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "PHI Reviewer"
abstract: >-
  A neurosymbolic PHI reviewer built with the cognition library. It reads a packet of clinical-trial
  documents, finds the protected health information that HIPAA Safe Harbor (45 CFR §164.514(b)(2))
  requires removing, and decides for each span whether to redact, generalize, keep, or escalate it to
  a human, citing the regulation and the evidence for every call.
